{"ticker":{"symbol":"058820.KQ","name":"CMG제약","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":3865.0,"change_pct":0.006510416666666741,"market_cap":53681852416.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":22050.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":242,"website":"https://www.cmgpharma.co.kr","business_summary":"CMG Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd., a pharmaceutical company, develops and sells oral thin film (OTF) pharmaceuticals in South Korea. It offers Tadalafil OTF products for erectile dysfunction; Entecavir OTF products to treat hepatitis type B; Aripiprazole OTF products for schizophrenia; and Montelukast OTF products to treat asthma and allergic rhinitis. CMG Pharmaceutical Co. Ltd. has a strategic collaboration agreement with Handok Inc. for cancer treatment. The company was formerly known as Skynewpharm Co Ltd and changed its name to CMG Pharmaceutical CO., Ltd. in April 2013. CMG Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd. was founded in 2001 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"제약회사인 CMG제약(주)은 한국에서 경구용박막(OTF) 의약품을 개발 및 판매하고 있습니다. 발기부전을 위한 Tadalafil OTF 제품을 제공합니다. B형 간염 치료를 위한 엔테카비르 OTF 제품; 정신분열증을 위한 아리피프라졸 OTF 제품; 천식 및 알레르기성 비염 치료를 위한 Montelukast OTF 제품. (주)씨엠지제약은 (주)한독과 암 치료를 위한 전략적 협력 계약을 체결했습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Skynewpharm Co Ltd로 알려졌으며 2013년 4월에 CMG Pharmaceutical CO., Ltd.로 이름을 변경했습니다. CMG Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd.는 2001년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"제약 (스페셜티·제네릭)","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":82197409660.0,"operating_income":2981395790.0,"net_income":-388139910.0,"eps":-30.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":93906675100.0,"operating_income":3036940890.0,"net_income":6455349070.0,"eps":460.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":990